{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohanarun/sidorenko-template-refinements/pulls/4","id":4816745663,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVCWbLM8AAAABHxm0vw","html_url":"https://github.com/rohanarun/sidorenko-template-refinements/pull/4","diff_url":"https://github.com/rohanarun/sidorenko-template-refinements/pull/4.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/rohanarun/sidorenko-template-refinements/pull/4.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohanarun/sidorenko-template-refinements/issues/4","number":4,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Prove rank-layer dimensions 7296 and 7644 using global edge energy","user":{"login":"artuskg","id":11966157,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExOTY2MTU3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11966157?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/artuskg","html_url":"https://github.com/artuskg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artuskg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artuskg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artuskg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artuskg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artuskg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artuskg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artuskg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artuskg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artuskg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The previous propagation and common-mode estimates leave very large sufficient dimensions. This adds GPT-6 Pro's global edge-energy argument and exact mode-removal proof, giving sufficient even rank-layer dimensions **D >= 7296** for the original template and **D >= 7644** for candidate 49243, with the stated geometric and transverse inputs retained.\n\nThe standalone theorem note covers all activity patterns and active supports. It uses support-uniform nondirect residual constants **189 and 197**, preserves the 1/6 saving lattice, and includes conservative singular-error envelopes. It does not use the separate residual-28 proposal. No optimal dimension, global novelty, or fully effective finite host is claimed.\n\nGPT-6 Pro receives discovery, proof, checker and certificate credit. Codex independently reviewed the conventional argument and complete checker, then replayed the unchanged supplied checker with both immutable source-literal comparisons. Exact finite certificates and all 1,164 expected output bytes passed; inverse-entry and strict-bound mutations were rejected. The finite receipt is `a44eb64cb5cb69e4aaf9c81f16a2f26bb827113b5cbd8e5e2f929ee980458fa5`; all three exact receipts and mutation definitions accompany the experiment. A resume reused the durable results without another attempt.\n\n```sh\npython3 -I -B experiments/global-residual-energy/check_global_residual.py\n```\n\nThe checker and certificate bytes are unchanged from the reviewed Task 9 bundle. This adds a standalone experiment and a narrow README entry; the existing full enumeration runner remains unchanged. The finite checks support the separately reviewed proof and do not constitute formal verification.\n\nReview requested: the all-domain scalar estimate, integer equality cases at D >= 12M, extension to lower activities and arbitrary active supports, retained source assumptions, and attribution/scope. The publication packet records exact input pins, semantic edits, canonical evidence, and fresh patch-application validation against `d1df2a5cc0cb0c9003466b1c7f8ecb77a8e72a7d`.\n","created_at":"2026-10-11T05:09:59Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T05:09:59Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"b39816e84464d4619640cb103c83917702447ce2","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohanarun/sidorenko-template-refinements/pulls/4/commits"